			PRINTFORML 「Oh, you got money? Well, why didn'tcha say so? 'dat changes everythin'! I love money, gya!」
			PRINTFORMW 「We're always happy to see a good payin' customer!」
			IF !FLAG:周回数
				PRINTFORML 「Wow, so you came aaaall 'dis way just to soak in some water, gya? You're crazy, %PRINT_MALE("man_:girl", MASTER)%! Crazy!」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 
				PRINTFORMW 「And 'ey, you came right at 'da right time, %PRINT_MALE("buddy:sister", MASTER)%! Or as 'dey say in foreign lands, "guddo taimingu", gya!」
				PRINTFORML 「As luck would 'ave it, today's 'da big day we launch our new special service called "Nyuu Puran"!」
				;a little explanation
				PRINTFORML ..."Nyuu Puran"?
				PRINTFORML The attendant's assistant quietly informs you that it's actually called "New Plan", but is quickly shushed.
				PRINTFORML 「Oi, shut it! And don't interrupt me! I know how to spell 'dose fancy foreign words better 'dan anyone, gya!」
				;--------------------
				PRINTFORMW 「Ahem! Basically, we got a bunch of hot chicks for you to choose from, all lined up in one fine place ready to have some fun wit' ya!」
				PRINTFORML 「And 'dey're all dyin' for ya to spend some of 'dat sweet coin on 'em, dear customer!」
				PRINTFORML 
				PRINTFORMW 「So c'mon, time's a wastin'! Get out 'dere, pick one right now and 'ave a blast, gya! Go, go!」
				PRINTFORML 「Ge-he-he...!」
				PRINTFORMW The youkai attendant lets out a cackle with a dirty grin and ushers you on...
				SETBIT SENTO_FLAG:9, 旧地獄温泉_BIT_ニュープラン_完成
				GOTO SKIP
			ENDIF
		;にゅーぷらん開放から初めて来た
		ELSEIF !GETBIT(SENTO_FLAG:9, 旧地獄温泉_BIT_ニュープラン_完成) && 旧地獄温泉_ニュープラン_完成日 && DAY >= 旧地獄温泉_ニュープラン_完成日
			PRINTFORML 「'ullo 'dere, visitor! Welcome to our humble establishment, gya!」
			PRINTFORML 「And 'ey, you came right at 'da right time, %PRINT_MALE("buddy:sister", MASTER)%! Or as 'dey say in foreign lands, "guddo taimingu", gya!」
			PRINTFORML 「As luck would 'ave it, today's 'da big day we launch our new special service called "Nyuu Puran"!」
			PRINTFORML 「Basically, we got a bunch of hot chicks for you to choose from, all lined up in one fine place ready to have some fun wit' ya!」
			PRINTFORMW 「And 'dey're all dyin' for ya to spend some of 'dat sweet coin on 'em, dear customer!」
			PRINTFORML
			PRINTFORMW 「So c'mon, time's a wastin'! Get out 'dere, pick one right now and 'ave a blast, gya! Go, go!」
			PRINTFORML 「Ge-he-he...!」
			PRINTFORMW The youkai attendant lets out a cackle with a dirty grin and ushers you on...
			SETBIT SENTO_FLAG:9, 旧地獄温泉_BIT_ニュープラン_完成
			GOTO SKIP
