					PRINTFORMW 「Forget it, I say, forget it. You're such a wuss you'll scare away all 'da chicks before 'da action, gya!」
					CLEARLINE 2
					GOTO LOOP_titei
				ELSEIF FLAG:デート相手
					PRINTFORML 「Hey %PRINT_MALE("buddy:sister", MASTER)%, don'tcha know when to quit while you're ahead, gya?」
